# Local SDK path. Copied to `local.properties` on first checkout; the
# `local.properties` file itself is gitignored. The SDK location is
# used by AGP to find build-tools, platforms, etc.
#
# The most common locations are:
#   - Linux:   ~/Android/Sdk
#   - macOS:   ~/Library/Android/sdk
#   - Windows: C:\\Users\\<you>\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
sdk.dir=/Users/you/Library/Android/sdk
